# Coomeva Hackathon API - Script de Pruebas

## Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = 

### 1. Registro de Usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Usuario",
  "documentNumber": "9999999999",
  "phone": "3009999999",
  "address": "Calle 123 #45-67, Cali"
}

###

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@coomeva.com",
  "password": "usuario123"
}

###

### 3. Login como Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@coomeva.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 4. Obtener todos los servicios
GET {{baseUrl}}/services

###

### 5. Obtener servicios disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/available

###

### 6. Obtener servicios por tipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/type/SALUD

###

### 7. Buscar servicios
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/search?keyword=médico

###

### 8. Obtener todas las categorías
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

###

### 9. Obtener todas las alianzas
GET {{baseUrl}}/alliances

###

### 10. Obtener alianzas activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/alliances/active

###

### 11. Crear una orden (requiere auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "serviceId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "serviceId": 2,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Orden de prueba para servicios de salud"
}

###

### 12. Obtener mis órdenes (requiere auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13. Procesar pago (requiere auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111",
  "cardHolderName": "Test Usuario",
  "expiryDate": "12/26",
  "cvv": "123"
}

###

### 14. Obtener pago por orden (requiere auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/order/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. Crear servicio (requiere admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo Servicio de Salud",
  "description": "Descripción del servicio",
  "price": 150000,
  "type": "SALUD",
  "available": true,
  "imageUrl": "https://via.placeholder.com/300",
  "category": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

###

### 16. Crear categoría (requiere admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nueva Categoría",
  "description": "Descripción de la categoría",
  "icon": "🎯"
}

###

### 17. Crear alianza (requiere admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/alliances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nueva Alianza Empresarial",
  "description": "Descripción de la alianza",
  "website": "https://ejemplo.com",
  "contactEmail": "contacto@ejemplo.com",
  "contactPhone": "602-1234567",
  "active": true,
  "logoUrl": "https://via.placeholder.com/150"
}

###

### 18. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###

### 19. Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

###
